        // If refund succeeded then C's balance decreased by exactly the amount gained by this contract.
        // If it reverted, no guarantees. We assert the general invariant: either refund reverted, or
        // funds moved from c to this contract preserving total (beforeC == afterC + (afterThis - beforeThis)).
